#: usr/share/archlinux-tweak-tool/plymouth_gui.py:49
msgid ""
"Install adds the plymouth hook to <tt>/etc/mkinitcpio.conf</tt> and rebuilds "
"initramfs.\n"
"Remove strips the hook, optionally cleans <tt>quiet splash</tt> from the "
"kernel cmdline,\n"
"optionally removes <tt>plymouth-theme-*</tt> packages, and rebuilds "
"initramfs.\n"
"Every step is shown in the terminal — prompts ask before destructive cleanup."
msgstr ""
"Instalar adiciona o hook plymouth a <tt>/etc/mkinitcpio.conf</tt> e "
"reconstrói o initramfs.\n"
"Remover retira o hook, opcionalmente limpa <tt>quiet splash</tt> da linha de "
"comando do kernel,\n"
"opcionalmente remove os pacotes <tt>plymouth-theme-*</tt> e reconstrói o "
"initramfs.\n"
"Cada etapa é mostrada no terminal: há perguntas antes de qualquer limpeza "
"destrutiva."

